<header class="ref-head"><span class="hero-ornament"></span><h1 class="research-title">16 June in history</h1><p class="ref-lede">8 events that happened on 16 June, from 632 to 1976.</p></header>
<ol class="day-events"><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/years/632">632 CE</a> <span class="tih-ago">1,394 years ago</span></p><h2 class="tih-event-title">Yazdegerd III, the last Sasanian king, takes the throne</h2><p class="tih-event-desc"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/yazdegerd-iii">Yazdegerd III</a> came to the throne of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sasanian-empire">Sasanian Empire</a> at the age of eight. His death in 651, after successive defeats by the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/rashidun-caliphate">Rashidun Caliphate</a>, marked the end of the last pre-Islamic Iranian empire.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sasanian-empire">Sasanian Empire</a></div></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/years/1407">1407 CE</a> <span class="tih-ago">619 years ago</span></p><h2 class="tih-event-title">Ming forces capture Hồ Quý Ly, ruler of Đại Ngu</h2><p class="tih-event-desc">Ming forces captured <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ho-quy-ly">Hồ Quý Ly</a>, founder of the Hồ dynasty, and his son <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ho-han-thuong">Hồ Hán Thương</a> in present-day Hà Tĩnh Province and brought them as prisoners to the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/yongle-emperor">Yongle Emperor</a> in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/nanjing">Nanjing</a>. Đại Ngu became the Ming province of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/jiaozhi">Jiaozhi</a>.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ho-quy-ly">Hồ Quý Ly</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ming-empire">Ming Empire</a></div></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/years/1487">1487 CE</a> <span class="tih-ago">539 years ago</span></p><h2 class="tih-event-title">Henry VII defeats the Yorkist rebels at Stoke Field</h2><p class="tih-event-desc">Henry VII crushed a rebel army supporting the pretender Lambert Simnel. It is often counted as the last battle of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/wars-of-the-roses">Wars of the Roses</a>.</p></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/years/1779">1779 CE</a> <span class="tih-ago">247 years ago</span></p><h2 class="tih-event-title">Spain declares war on Britain</h2><p class="tih-event-desc"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/spain">Spain</a> joined <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/france">France</a> in the American War of Independence, aiming to recover <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/gibraltar">Gibraltar</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/menorca">Minorca</a>. The Great Siege of Gibraltar that followed lasted more than three years.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/gibraltar">Gibraltar</a></div></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/years/1858">1858 CE</a> <span class="tih-ago">168 years ago</span></p><h2 class="tih-event-title">Lincoln delivers his 'House Divided' speech</h2><p class="tih-event-desc">Accepting the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/illinois">Illinois</a> Republican nomination for the Senate, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/abraham-lincoln">Abraham Lincoln</a> warned that the nation could not endure 'permanently half slave and half free'. The speech raised his national profile.</p></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/years/1903">1903 CE</a> <span class="tih-ago">123 years ago</span></p><h2 class="tih-event-title">Ford Motor Company is incorporated</h2><p class="tih-event-desc">Henry Ford and eleven investors founded the company in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/detroit">Detroit</a>. Its Model T and moving assembly line made cars affordable to millions.</p></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/years/1963">1963 CE</a> <span class="tih-ago">63 years ago</span></p><h2 class="tih-event-title">Valentina Tereshkova becomes the first woman in space</h2><p class="tih-event-desc">Soviet cosmonaut Valentina Tereshkova launched aboard Vostok 6 and orbited Earth 48 times in nearly three days. No other woman flew in space for 19 years.</p></div></li><li class="tih-event-card tih-event-hero"><p class="tih-hero-kicker">&#10022; Anniversary of the day</p><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/years/1976">1976 CE</a> <span class="tih-ago">50 years ago</span></p><h2 class="tih-event-title">Police fire on students in Soweto</h2><p class="tih-event-desc">Police shot at schoolchildren marching against compulsory <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/afrikaans">Afrikaans</a> teaching, killing 13-year-old Hector Pieterson among others. The uprising spread, and hundreds died in the months that followed.</p></div></li></ol>
