<section class="day-ppl" aria-labelledby="day-died"><h2 class="ref-sec-title" id="day-died">Died on 16 June <span class="n">5</span></h2><ul class="enc-seealso"><li><a href="/encyclopedia/hugh-the-great"><span class="ph ph-person" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><span class="nm">Hugh the Great</span><span class="tp">c. 898–956</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/christian-the-younger-of-brunswick"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/christian-the-younger-of-brunswick.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Christian the Younger of Brunswick</span><span class="tp">1599–1626</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/john-churchill-1st-duke-of-marlborough"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/john-churchill-1st-duke-of-marlborough.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">John Churchill, 1st Duke of Marlborough</span><span class="tp">1650–1722</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/imre-nagy"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/imre-nagy.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Imre Nagy</span><span class="tp">1896–1958</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/helmut-kohl"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/helmut-kohl.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Helmut Kohl</span><span class="tp">1930–2017</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
<p class="day-ppl-note">Dates as the sources give them: in the Julian calendar before 1582, and in some countries for longer (Britain until 1752, Russia until 1918). Only people whose day of birth or death the records agree on are listed.</p>
